{"message":"The documented PIN procedure requires a PIN reset, including confirmation of the card’s last four digits and a new PIN; I don’t have a separate procedure for unlocking a PIN-locked card while keeping the existing PIN.

For security, please retrieve the last four digits from the physical Green Account card itself. If you don’t have the card available, don’t send the full card number or CVV in chat. Once you have the last four digits, send only those four digits and a new four-digit PIN. The new PIN must not be sequential, all identical digits, or your birth year/month/day.

If you prefer not to change the PIN or cannot locate the card, I can help arrange review by a human agent."}
